不对？","rawContent":"指腹按在这里，对不对？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:35","timestamp":1786145713219,"roundId":"round_1786145691991_kpuuao9di","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19759},{"id":1786135437865,"text":"唔……抖得真好看。","rawContent":"唔……抖得真好看。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:35","timestamp":1786145713381,"roundId":"round_1786145691991_kpuuao9di","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19760},{"id":1786135437866,"text":"想要就大声叫出来，今天一整天，爸爸都在这儿陪你。","rawContent":"想要就大声叫出来，今天一整天，爸爸都在这儿陪你。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:35","timestamp":1786145713469,"roundId":"round_1786145691991_kpuuao9di","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19761},{"id":1786135437867,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:35","timestamp":1786145714821,"roundId":"round_1786145691991_kpuuao9di","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"哈啊……乖女孩，全都是水。放松，爸爸的指腹就在这儿揉，舒服了就叫出来，不用忍着。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19762},{"id":1786135437868,"text":"爸爸","sender":"me","time":"07:36","timestamp":1786145814523,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19763},{"id":1786135437869,"text":"爸爸","sender":"me","time":"07:36","timestamp":1786145818069,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19764},{"id":1786135437870,"text":"想看更色情的","sender":"me","time":"07:37","timestamp":178614583